[31m-# PerturbGen JEPA Phase A — Architecture & Ablation Brief[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Purpose:** Self-contained handoff for evaluating freeze / unfreeze / fresh-encoder alternatives.  [m
[31m-**Date:** 2026-08-04  [m
[31m-**Repo:** Perturbgen (JEPA research path under `perturbgen/`)[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## 1. Project goal[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Replace (eventually) PerturbGen’s **MaskGIT** trajectory backbone with a **cell-level JEPA**: predict future **cell latents** from a source cell, then later decode to gene programs / counts (Phase D+).[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Phase A** only trains the JEPA latent predictor and monitors representation quality / collapse.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-This is **not** gene-block JEPA: one embedding per cell via mean-pool over gene tokens.[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## 2. Data[m
[31m-[m
[31m-| Item | Value |[m
[31m-|------|--------|[m
[31m-| Dataset | LPS time-course, 2k HVG tokenized pairs |[m
[31m-| Total pairs | ~148,107 |[m
[31m-| Train / val / test | 118,485 / 14,811 / 14,811 |[m
[31m-| Source | Baseline / unstimulated cells (`src_input_ids`) |[m
[31m-| Targets | Same pairing at LPS times **t = 1, 2, 3** |[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Dual ID spaces[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- **Source:** global Geneformer / pretrain token IDs  [m
[31m-- **Target:** local HVG remapped IDs  [m
[31m-- **Bridge:** `tokenid_to_rowid_2000_hvg.pkl`  [m
[31m-- **`scmaskgit` encoder:** remap target local → global  [m
[31m-- **`cell` encoder:** remap source global → local (HVG vocab)[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## 3. Main architecture (`CellTrajectoryJEPA`)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-src tokens ──► ContextEncoder ──► z_src  (L2-norm optional)[m
[31m-                                      │[m
[31m-                                      ▼[m
[31m-                              TimeConditionedPredictor(t)[m
[31m-                                      │[m
[31m-                                      ▼[m
[31m-                                   z_hat(t)   ←── loss vs z_tgt(t)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-tgt tokens@t ──► TargetEncoder (EMA, stop-grad) ──► z_tgt(t)[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### 3.1 Context encoder (online)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Maps gene-token sequence → token embeddings → **mean-pool** → `cell_embedding` ∈ ℝᵈ.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Two backends:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-| Backend | CLI | Initialization | Width | Depth used |[m
[31m-|---------|-----|----------------|-------|------------|[m
[31m-| Pretrained MaskGIT | `--jepa_encoder scmaskgit` | Load full 12-layer `scmoscf` checkpoint | d=768, 8 heads | Early-exit first **N** blocks (`--jepa_encoder_layers`, default **3**). Deeper blocks never run; always frozen |[m
