[31m-### 3.2 Target encoder (EMA)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Deep copy of the context encoder; all parameters `requires_grad=False`[m
[31m-- Updated each training batch:  [m
[31m-  `θ_tgt ← τ · θ_tgt + (1 − τ) · θ_ctx` with `τ = ema_decay` (default **0.996**)[m
[31m-- Forward under `torch.no_grad()` / eval mode[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### 3.3 Predictor[m
[31m-[m
[31m-`TimeConditionedPredictor`:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Time embedding for target time index `t`[m
[31m-- MLP on `[z_src ‖ t_emb] → z_hat` (GELU MLP, hidden = 4×d)[m
[31m-- Always trained in Phase A[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Times predicted jointly: **t ∈ {1, 2, 3}** from the **same** `z_src`.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### 3.4 Normalization[m
[31m-[m
[31m-If `normalize_latents=true` (default): L2-normalize `z_src`, `z_tgt`, and `z_hat` before the loss.[m
