[31m-| Inputs | Shared LPS tokenized data is OK (data reuse, not model blending) |[m
[31m-| CLI | `train-jepa`, `train-jepa-decoder`, `eval-jepa` |[m
[31m-| Notebooks 04–05 | Not success criteria for Phase A; MaskGIT extract/programs stay on their own track |[m
[31m-| Screens / GPUs | Use a dedicated screen (e.g. `jepa_train`); avoid sharing cards with a concurrent masking extract job |[m
