[31m-## 3. Architecture[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```mermaid[m
[31m-flowchart LR[m
[31m-  srcTokens[SrcTokens] --> ctxEnc[ContextEncoder][m
[31m-  tgtTokens[TgtTokens] --> tgtEnc[TargetEncoderEMA][m
[31m-  ctxEnc --> zSrc[z_src][m
[31m-  tgtEnc --> zTgt[z_tgt_stopgrad][m
[31m-  zSrc --> pred[Predictor_plus_time][m
[31m-  pred --> zHat[z_hat_tgt][m
[31m-  zHat --> loss[MSE_latent][m
[31m-  zTgt --> loss[m
[31m-  zHat --> decoder[LaterDecoder][m
[31m-  decoder --> apps[Generation_and_Perturbation][m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- **Context encoder:** trainable; encodes source gene-token sequence → cell embedding `z_src`.[m
[31m-- **Target encoder:** EMA copy of the context encoder (stop-grad); encodes target timepoint → `z_tgt`.[m
[31m-- **Predictor:** time-conditioned MLP; maps `z_src` + target time → `z_hat`.[m
[31m-- **v0 unit:** cell-level mean-pooled embeddings (not gene-block JEPA yet).[m
[31m-- **Later:** decoder from latents → counts/tokens for generation and perturbation apps.[m
[31m-[m
