[31m-[m
[31m-| Component | Init |[m
[31m-|-----------|------|[m
[31m-| Encoder (`--jepa_encoder scmaskgit`, default) | Full pretrained MaskGIT / scmaskgit source encoder from `pretraining_cohort` (EMA twin for targets) |[m
[31m-| Encoder (`--jepa_encoder cell`) | Lightweight `CellEncoder`; optional token-emb warm-start from cohort ckpt; src IDs remapped via `tokenid_to_rowid` |[m
[31m-| Predictor | Random time-conditioned MLP |[m
[31m-| Training objective | Latent MSE / smooth-L1 — **not** MaskGIT CE |[m
[31m-[m
[31m-scmaskgit path remaps **target** HVG IDs → global pretrain IDs so both src and tgt share the big encoder vocab. JEPA does **not** run the MaskGIT demask loop.[m
