[31m-## 4. Phased research trajectory (A–F)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Phase A — Trainability (gate)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Question:** Can JEPA train stably on LPS src→tgt pairs?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Build: `CellTrajectoryJEPA` + `JEPATrainer`; CLI `--train_mode jepa`.[m
[31m-- Recipe: warm-start token emb; EMA τ ≈ 0.996; no token CE; no generation loop.[m
[31m-- **Pass:** train/val loss finite and decreasing; `collapse_std_mean` stays non-zero; no NaNs; optional UMAP structure by time/cell type.[m
[31m-- **Fail →** tune LR / EMA / capacity inside JEPA only.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Phase B — Representation quality[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Question:** Are JEPA latents biologically useful vs MaskGIT embeddings?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Compare cell embeddings (same LPS split): linear probes, silhouette, neighbor purity.[m
[31m-- **Pass:** match or beat MaskGIT on ≥2 metrics; clear structure by time/cell type.[m
[31m-- Run as a dedicated comparison job; do not mix result folders.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Phase C — Trajectory prediction[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Question:** Can we predict future cell state in latent space better than baselines?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Multi-horizon src→t1/t2/t3; baselines: identity (`z_src`), mean, MaskGIT+MLP.[m
[31m-- **Pass:** beat identity (and strong baselines) on held-out pairs; ablations explain the signal.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Phase D — Recover generation[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Question:** Can latents become expression again?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Attach count / expression head (`train-jepa-decoder`); freeze JEPA first, then light joint fine-tune.[m
[31m-- Evaluate with distribution metrics (e.g. MSE / MMD / EMD), not MaskGIT remask loops first.[m
[31m-- **Pass:** competitive fidelity vs MaskGIT on LPS target states before claiming replacement.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Phase E — Programs + perturbation (README apps)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Question:** Does JEPA support the three PerturbGen applications?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Gene programs from JEPA embeddings; latent intervention → predict `z_tgt` → decode; PIP-style atlas.[m
[31m-- **Pass:** end-to-end programs + perturbation atlas on JEPA; document wins/losses vs MaskGIT.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Phase F — Scale and replacement package[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Multi-dataset / pretraining-cohort JEPA only after LPS replacement bar holds.[m
[31m-- Package: representation + trajectory + generation + perturbation comparison.[m
