[31m-# JEPA Research Trajectory (PerturbGen Replacement)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## Goal[m
[31m-Replace PerturbGen’s MaskGIT token-prediction backbone with a **JEPA trajectory backbone**, while eventually recovering the same applications: target-state prediction, gene programs, and in silico perturbation atlases.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Principle:** parallel thin path first; do not rewrite MaskGIT demask/remask until representations work. Reuse data, Lightning harness, and pretrained encoder weights.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## Architecture target[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```mermaid[m
[31m-flowchart LR[m
[31m-  srcTokens[SrcTokens] --> ctxEnc[ContextEncoder][m
[31m-  tgtTokens[TgtTokens] --> tgtEnc[TargetEncoderEMA][m
[31m-  ctxEnc --> zSrc[z_src][m
[31m-  tgtEnc --> zTgt[z_tgt_stopgrad][m
[31m-  zSrc --> pred[Predictor_plus_time][m
[31m-  pred --> zHat[z_hat_tgt][m
[31m-  zHat --> loss[MSE_latent][m
[31m-  zTgt --> loss[m
[31m-  zHat --> decoder[LaterDecoder][m
[31m-  decoder --> apps[Generation_and_Perturbation][m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- **Context encoder:** init from current masking ckpt in [`Perturbgen/perturbgen/Modules/transformer.py`](Perturbgen/perturbgen/Modules/transformer.py) (`PerturbGen` / mean-pool via `mean_nonpadding_embs`).[m
[31m-- **Target encoder:** EMA copy of context encoder (stop-grad).[m
[31m-- **Predictor:** small MLP/Transformer conditioned on target time.[m
[31m-- **v0 unit:** cell-level embedding (`mean_embedding`), not gene tokens.[m
[31m-- **Later:** decoder from latents back to tokens/counts for generation + KO simulation.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## What we reuse vs ignore early[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Reuse**[m
[31m-- Paired LPS data + [`Perturbgen/perturbgen/Dataloaders/datamodule.py`](Perturbgen/perturbgen/Dataloaders/datamodule.py)[m
[31m-- Train shell in [`Perturbgen/perturbgen/train.py`](Perturbgen/perturbgen/train.py) (add `train_mode=jepa`)[m
[31m-- Lightning patterns from [`Perturbgen/perturbgen/Model/trainer.py`](Perturbgen/perturbgen/Model/trainer.py)[m
[31m-- Pretrained MaskGIT / scmaskgit source encoder under `Perturbgen/pretraining_cohort/` as default JEPA encoder (`--jepa_encoder scmaskgit`); lightweight `CellEncoder` remains via `--jepa_encoder cell`[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Ignore until Phase D**[m
[31m-- MaskGIT iterative demask/remask (`generate_sequence` in scmaskgit / PerturbGen)[m
[31m-- Count decoder training[m
[31m-- Gene embedding extraction notebooks 04–05 as success criteria for Phase A[m
[31m-[m
