[31m-[m
[31m-## Phase B — Representation quality[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Question:** Are JEPA latents biologically useful vs MaskGIT embeddings?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Work**[m
[31m-- Extract cell embeddings from JEPA context/target encoders[m
[31m-- Compare to current masking-model embeddings (same LPS split)[m
[31m-- Metrics: time/cell-type linear probes, silhouette, neighbor purity[m
[31m-- Optional gene-level readout: attention-pool or token embeddings from encoder (still no generation)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Pass criteria**[m
[31m-- JEPA match or beat masking baseline on at least 2 representation metrics[m
[31m-- Clear qualitative structure by time / cell type[m
[31m-[m
