[31m-[m
[31m-## Phase C — Trajectory prediction as the scientific core[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Question:** Can we predict future cell state in latent space better than baselines?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Work**[m
[31m-- Multi-horizon: src → t1, t2, t3; held-out time extrapolation if data allows[m
[31m-- Baselines: identity (`z_src`), linear probe, frozen MaskGIT mean-embed + MLP[m
[31m-- Metrics: latent MSE/cosine; optional decode-later proxy once a tiny decoder exists[m
[31m-- Ablations: EMA on/off, time conditioning, init-from-ckpt vs scratch[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Pass criteria**[m
[31m-- Beats identity + MaskGIT+MLP on held-out pairs[m
[31m-- Ablations explain what carries the signal[m
[31m-[m
